# Ticket Flow Trigger Rule

When the user asks to process a ticket, fix a bug with an ID, work on a ticket, implement a feature with an ID, run ticket-flow, or handle a queue of tickets:

1. **Load and follow** the Ticket Flow skill at `.cursor/skills/ticket-flow/SKILL.md` (same path when this repo is the workspace root, or when rules/skills are copied into an app repo).
2. Do not freestyle the workflow sequence.
3. Enforce the **Confirm** gates before commit and before PR. Never treat silence as Confirm.
4. Stage only path-scoped changes relevant to the ticket.
5. Keep the naming glossary from the skill in mind (primary app vs suite vs shared UI).
